span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是多么美好的爱情故事呀 亲爱的 答应我吧</span></p><p begin="03:36.558" end="03:39.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:36.558" end="03:37.032">Oh,</span> <span begin="03:37.032" end="03:37.526">oh-</span><span begin="03:37.526" end="03:39.440">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh oh oh</span></p><p begin="03:40.591" end="03:43.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:40.591" end="03:41.067">Oh,</span> <span begin="03:41.067" end="03:42.359">oh-oh,</span> <span begin="03:42.359" end="03:43.912">oh</span></p><p begin="03:45.618" end="03:51.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:45.618" end="03:45.809">'Cause</span> <span begin="03:45.809" end="03:46.034">we</span> <span begin="03:46.034" end="03:46.274">were</span> <span begin="03:46.274" end="03:46.829">both</span> <span begin="03:46.829" end="03:47.609">young</span> <span begin="03:47.609" end="03:47.849">when</span> <span begin="03:47.849" end="03:48.089">I</span> <span begin="03:48.089" end="03:48.569">first</span> <span begin="03:48.569" end="03:49.634">saw</span> <span begin="03:49.634" end="03:51.068">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我第一次看见你的时候 那时我们还年轻</span></p></div></body></tt>